        "heading": "Share Your Idea with Us",
        "heading_level": "h1",
        "body": "<p>Do you have an idea for a special hiking experience? </p><p>Perhaps you are a photographer, yoga teacher, artist, guide, coach or simply someone with a meaningful idea to share.</p><p>Together with HIKE YOUR MIND, you can create a hike that brings people together through movement, nature and your chosen activity. You take care of the theme — what we will do, what kind of experience you want to offer and how many people you would like to invite.</p><p>HIKE YOUR MIND will take care of the route, hiking structure and practical planning, so the experience feels safe, thoughtful and close to nature.</p><p>Tell us about your idea, the preferred location, approximate time and how many people you imagine joining. </p><p>Please also leave your contacts so we can reach you.</p>",
